# Windows IIS & Legacy System Rules (Conditional)

- Apply `eng-deployment` and route IIS/ASP tasks to `windows-iis-engineer` / `legacy-asp-modernizer`.
- Preserve existing `web.config` bindings, Classic ASP request/session behavior, and live SQL Server schemas.
- Produce non-destructive PowerShell deployment & rollback scripts requiring explicit human approval; never restart IDE processes or stop unrelated IIS pools unexpectedly.
